 08:08:51.267 21951 22033 E godot   :    at: _create_all_heartparts (res://scripts/leveis-controllers/level1_controller.gd:136)\n\nAlso I removed this condition \"file_name.ends_with(\".tscn\")\" for the code that is inside the \"find\" condition execute.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566366458/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566371856","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100941#issuecomment-2566371856","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100941","id":2566371856,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y97oQ","user":{"login":"isumaeru-ruzu","id":193239854,"node_id":"U_kgDOC4SbLg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/193239854?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu","html_url":"https://github.com/isumaeru-ruzu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-31T11:34:05Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T11:34:05Z","body":"> > This code works here on my computer, however, it does not work on my cell phone. I noticed that the scenes within the application are \".tscn.remap\". I tried to add this check within my code but they do not load.\n> \n> [@isumaeru-ruzu](https://github.com/isumaeru-ruzu) You don't need to include `.tscn.remap`, you can load `.tscn` on Android.\n> \n> Also, please attach MRP without `android` and `.godot` folder.\n\nI updated the dropbox link and now it is without the \"Android\" and \".Godot\" folders. I find it very strange that this is happening, not wanting to load the scenes on Android. Now that I removed the check for the \".tscn\" extension, godot finds the files but does not load them.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566371856/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566394226","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100941#issuecomment-2566394226","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100941","id":2566394226,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y-BFy","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-31T12:06:57Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T12:06:57Z","body":"Can you load the files on your computer NOT from editor (from an exported build)?\n\nJudging from the lines you quoted the issue is with tscn.remap which is a thing that only occurs in exported builds","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566394226/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566407486","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100941#issuecomment-2566407486","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100941","id":2566407486,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y-EU-","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-31T12:26:22Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T12:26:22Z","body":"@isumaeru-ruzu Use this line before loading resource, `var fine_name = file_name.trim_suffix(\".remap\")`. It will just remove the `.remap` and then would work with `ResourceLoader.load(...)`\n\nIn context of your code:\n```\n\tif dir:\n\t\twhile true:\n\t\t\tvar file_name = dir.get_next()\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tfile_name = file_name.trim_suffix(\".remap\")\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tif not file_name == \"\": print(\"File found: \", file_name)\n\t\t\telse: print(\"End of directory.\"); break\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566407486/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566433386","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100941#issuecomment-2566433386","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100941","id":2566433386,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y-Kpq","user":{"login":"isumaeru-ruzu","id":193239854,"node_id":"U_kgDOC4SbLg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/193239854?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu","html_url":"https://github.com/isumaeru-ruzu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-31T12:55:27Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T12:55:27Z","body":"> [@isumaeru-ruzu](https://github.com/isumaeru-ruzu) Use this line before loading resource, `var fine_name = file_name.trim_suffix(\".remap\")`. It will just remove the `.remap` and then would work with `ResourceLoader.load(...)`\n> \n> In context of your code:\n> \n> ```\n> \tif dir:\n> \t\twhile true:\n> \t\t\tvar file_name = dir.get_next()\n> \t\t\t\n> \t\t\tfile_name = file_name.trim_suffix(\".remap\")\n> \t\t\t\n> \t\t\tif not file_name == \"\": print(\"File found: \", file_name)\n> \t\t\telse: print(\"End of directory.\"); break\n> ```\n\n@syntaxerror247 Thanks, it worked here! The scenes representing the parts of the heart loaded here!\n\nI also really liked the explanation that user uwumacaronitime wrote on discord:\n\n> uwumacaronitime — Hoje às 09:06\nWhen godot packs a project, files in the virtual directory become .remap files of what they previously were\nThis isn't a bug, it's just a thing\nTo load a file, literally just remove .remap from the string\nVia string.replace(\".remap\", \"\")\nThis isn't exclusive to android","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566433386/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566443906","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100941#issuecomment-2566443906","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100941","id":2566443906,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y-NOC","user":{"login":"isumaeru-ruzu","id":193239854,"node_id":"U_kgDOC4SbLg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/193239854?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu","html_url":"https://github.com/isumaeru-ruzu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isumaeru-ruzu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-31T13:10:11Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T13:10:11Z","body":"> Can you load the files on your computer NOT from editor (from an exported build)?\n> \n> Judging from the lines you quoted the issue is with tscn.remap which is a thing that only occurs in exported builds\n\n@Zireael07 Yes, I could load the \".tscn\" files on my computer but not on my cell phone. I'm using remote debug to test my application on my cell phone, but I haven't created an exported build to test. Indeed, the problem was in the \".remap\" suffix.\n\nWell, thank you very much to you! @Zireael07 @syntaxerror247 ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566443906/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]